    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Aquarium \u2013 That Aquarium.</strong><br>The one you had as a kid, dreamed of having, or just stood in front of with your nose against the glass. The one that makes you smile when you remember it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Aquarium</i> is a cosy and relaxing game, you can build and decorate your aquarium. Buy, raise, and sell fish. Discover new species. And sometimes, just sit back and watch. Because, like any real aquarium, The Aquarium aims to bring peace and calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise fish, discover new species.</strong><br><i>The Aquarium</i> lets you explore new fish species based on your experience. Create the right environment and take care of them, watch them grow. You\u2019ll follow their progress and learn what they need. You\u2019ll also manage a small hobby budget as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Aquarium</i> is cosy, fun, relaxing, and full of calm moments, a peaceful escape, whenever you need it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Aquarium \u2013 That Aquarium.</strong><br>The one you had as a kid, dreamed of having, or just stood in front of with your nose against the glass. The one that makes you smile when you remember it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Aquarium</i> is a cosy and relaxing game, you can build and decorate your aquarium. Buy, raise, and sell fish. Discover new species. And sometimes, just sit back and watch. Because, like any real aquarium, The Aquarium aims to bring peace and calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise fish, discover new species.</strong><br><i>The Aquarium</i> lets you explore new fish species based on your experience. Create the right environment and take care of them, watch them grow. You\u2019ll follow their progress and learn what they need. You\u2019ll also manage a small hobby budget as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Aquarium</i> is cosy, fun, relaxing, and full of calm moments, a peaceful escape, whenever you need it.</p>",
